{"change_summary":"Completed the pending shrimp/budget remediation in the current tree: shrimp feeding and reserve routing now rely on the shared `AnimalState` helper paths, the stale proportional reserve-spend helper was removed, adult shrimp removal semantics are validated against adult-only reserve export, and the structural budget-path coverage now recognizes nested `animal.<stage>.count` and `animal.<stage>.reserve_g` fields. The renamed trim-plants helper coverage was also revalidated via the budget-helper test suite.","outstanding_risks":["Budget-path auto-discovery now covers one-segment nested cohort paths like `animal.larvae.count` and `animal.larvae.reserve_g`, but any deeper nesting or array-based animal mass pools would still need explicit helper updates.","The worktree still contains an unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory, which was left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the pending amendments against the current `tank_core` shrimp, engine, and budget-tracking code to determine which regressions still needed implementation versus revalidation.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Consolidated shrimp feeding/reserve behavior onto the shared `AnimalState` helpers, removed the unused proportional reserve-spend path, and kept the shrimp unit tests aligned with the shared feeding-unit calculation.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Verified the adult-only `RemoveShrimp` reserve semantics and broadened budget coverage expectations so future nested animal cohorts are caught by the structural budget tests.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran focused `tank_core` library and integration tests covering shrimp routing, shrimp population/removal behavior, budget helpers, and budget tracking.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_core --lib shrimp` passed: 4 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test shrimp_population --test budget_tracking --test budget_helpers` passed: 50 tests passed across the three integration targets, 0 failed.","`git status --short` showed no tracked-file changes remaining; only unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` remains."]}